{"id":"ma-fig-001","s":"maths","t":"p1-05","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows a straight line through the marked points A and B. Which equation represents this line?","o":["$2x+3y-4=0$","$3x+2y-4=0$","$3x-2y+4=0$","$3x+2y+4=0$"],"a":1,"x":"Read A$(-2,5)$ and B$(2,-1)$. Gradient $=\\frac{-1-5}{2-(-2)}=-\\frac32$. Using B: $y+1=-\\frac32(x-2)$, so $y=-\\frac32x+2$, which gives $3x+2y-4=0$.","w":["Takes the gradient as change in $x$ over change in $y$, giving $-\\frac23$ instead of $-\\frac32$.","","Ignores the downward slope and takes the gradient as $+\\frac32$, so the line would rise to the right.","Gets the gradient right but the $y$-intercept has the wrong sign. The graph crosses the $y$-axis at $+2$, not $-2$."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[-4,4],"y":[-2,6],"xstep":1,"ystep":1,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[-2.5,5.75],[2.5,-1.75]],"c":0}],"points":[{"at":[-2,5],"label":"A"},{"at":[2,-1],"label":"B"}],"xnums":true,"ynums":true}}
{"id":"ma-fig-002","s":"maths","t":"p1-05","lv":3,"q":"The graph shows line $l$ and point P on it. Line $m$ is perpendicular to $l$ and passes through P. Find the area of the triangle bounded by $l$, $m$ and the $x$-axis.","o":["$22.5$","$18$","$5.25$","$11.25$"],"a":3,"x":"$l$ meets the $x$-axis at $(-4,0)$ and passes through P$(2,3)$, so its gradient is $\\frac12$. Then $m$ has gradient $-2$: $y-3=-2(x-2)$, meeting the $x$-axis at $3.5$. Area $=\\frac12\\times7.5\\times3=11.25$.","w":["Uses base $\\times$ height and forgets the factor $\\frac12$ for a triangle.","Uses gradient $-\\frac12$ for $m$, changing the sign but not taking the reciprocal. Then $m$ meets the $x$-axis at 8, giving base 12.","Takes the base as the distance from the origin to $m$'s $x$-intercept, ignoring that $l$ meets the axis at $-4$.",""],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[-5,4],"y":[-1,5],"xstep":1,"ystep":1,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[-5,-0.5],[4,4]],"label":"l","c":0}],"points":[{"at":[2,3],"label":"P"}],"xnums":true,"ynums":true}}
{"id":"ma-fig-007","s":"maths","t":"m1-09","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows a particle moving in a straight line with constant acceleration. Use the graph to find the particle's displacement over the whole time shown.","o":["32 m","80 m","96 m","160 m"],"a":2,"x":"The graph is a straight line from (0, 4) to (8, 20). Displacement is the area under it, a trapezium: $\\frac{1}{2}(4+20)\\times 8=96$ m.","w":["Took only the initial velocity multiplied by the time, $4\\times8$, ignoring the extra area from the acceleration.","Used a triangle $\\frac{1}{2}\\times8\\times20$, as if the particle started from rest, leaving out the rectangle under the line.","","Took final velocity multiplied by time, $20\\times8$, which treats the velocity as constant at its largest value."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,8],"y":[0,24],"xstep":1,"ystep":4,"xlabel":"time / s","ylabel":"velocity / m/s","lines":[{"pts":[[0,4],[8,20]],"c":0}],"points":[{"at":[0,4],"label":"A"},{"at":[8,20],"label":"B"}],"xnums":true,"ynums":true}}
{"id":"ma-fig-008","s":"maths","t":"m1-09","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows the displacement of a particle moving in a straight line with constant acceleration. P is the turning point. Use the graph to find the initial velocity of the particle.","o":["5 m/s","10 m/s","20 m/s","2.5 m/s"],"a":1,"x":"At the turning point P, $v=0$ at $t=2$ s, with $s=10$ m. Using $s=\\frac{1}{2}(u+v)t$: $10=\\frac{1}{2}(u+0)\\times2$, so $u=10$ m/s.","w":["Used $s=ut$ with $s=10$ and $t=2$. That is the average velocity, not the initial velocity.","","Multiplied the displacement by the time, $10\\times2$, instead of using a suvat equation with $v=0$.","Divided the displacement by $t^2$, $10\\div4$, which ignores the $\\frac{1}{2}at^2$ term."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,4],"y":[0,12],"xstep":0.5,"ystep":2,"xlabel":"time / s","ylabel":"displacement / m","lines":[{"pts":[[0.0,0.0],[0.025,0.248438],[0.05,0.49375],[0.075,0.735938],[0.1,0.975],[0.125,1.210938],[0.15,1.44375],[0.175,1.673437],[0.2,1.9],[0.225,2.123438],[0.25,2.34375],[0.275,2.560938],[0.3,2.775],[0.325,2.985937],[0.35,3.19375],[0.375,3.398438],[0.4,3.6],[0.425,3.798437],[0.45,3.99375],[0.475,4.185937],[0.5,4.375],[0.525,4.560937],[0.55,4.74375],[0.575,4.923438],[0.6,5.1],[0.625,5.273438],[0.65,5.44375],[0.675,5.610938],[0.7,5.775],[0.725,5.935937],[0.75,6.09375],[0.775,6.248437],[0.8,6.4],[0.825,6.548438],[0.85,6.69375],[0.875,6.835938],[0.9,6.975],[0.925,7.110938],[0.95,7.24375],[0.975,7.373437],[1.0,7.5],[1.025,7.623437],[1.05,7.74375],[1.075,7.860938],[1.1,7.975],[1.125,8.085938],[1.15,8.19375],[1.175,8.298437],[1.2,8.4],[1.225,8.498437],[1.25,8.59375],[1.275,8.685938],[1.3,8.775],[1.325,8.860938],[1.35,8.94375],[1.375,9.023438],[1.4,9.1],[1.425,9.173437],[1.45,9.24375],[1.475,9.310937],[1.5,9.375],[1.525,9.435938],[1.55,9.49375],[1.575,9.548438],[1.6,9.6],[1.625,9.648438],[1.65,9.69375],[1.675,9.735938],[1.7,9.775],[1.725,9.810937],[1.75,9.84375],[1.775,9.873438],[1.8,9.9],[1.825,9.923438],[1.85,9.94375],[1.875,9.960938],[1.9,